# Media Picker Sheet

::summary
The SHARED media picker (the iOS MessageImagePickerSheet idiom): Surfspace image library FIRST — a Recents grid of workspace media tiles (Gallery block) — then the OS Photo Library escape row below the separator. Messages attach and Posts compose both reuse this ONE sheet; the name stays `media-picker` with no surface-specific alias.
::

::modal[name=media-picker title="Send an image" width=360 placement=centered dismissible=true]

:::toolbar
- text[value="Recents"]
:::

:::gallery[columns=3 action=pickMedia]
![1.6.1-hero.png](1.6.1-hero.png)
![surfspace-demo.mp4](surfspace-demo.mp4)
![board-dark.png](board-dark.png)
:::

:::row[icon=folder action=openOsPhotoLibrary href=#]
Photo Library
OS picker escape row below the grid separator
:::

::

Top-right ✕ per dismiss canon. A tile pick attaches and closes; the Photo Library row hands off to the OS file/photo picker. When opened from Posts compose the picked media lands in the compose media well and enters per-platform transcode.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) the sheet goes edge-to-edge with 10px side insets and auto width; the wide placement declared on the block is unchanged.
